[0;1;38;2;37;99;235mDescription
[0m  Shows what ConsoleMonster detected about the current terminal.

  Returns the terminal profile: kind, mode (Interactive, Stream, Plain), colour depth, glyph tier, size, VT support,
  console font and the reasons behind each decision. -Refresh detects again (after a resize or font change).

